\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af37 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f37\kerning0\insrsid5377856 \hich\af37\dbch\af31505\loch\f37 Executive Summary}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af37 \ltrch\fcs0 \f37\kerning0\insrsid5377856 
\par \hich\af37\dbch\af31505\loch\f37 
Turn the existing Windows (WPF) app into a multi-user product. Users register on a small web portal, choose a plan, and the desktop app enforces plan limits (profiles + 60 actions per profile/day). Start lean, ship fast, and add payment automation later.

\par 
